# Keeps data/ in the repo even when every pack is absent.
#
# This folder holds the authored JSON packs the app fetches at runtime:
#   questions.json · numericals/*.json (+ index.json) · formulas.json
#   diagrams.json · examCalendar.json · quotes.json
#
# generate_data.py MERGES packs from <vault>/data into here and never prunes
# this folder, because content agents commit packs straight into the hub repo.
# Directory listings do not exist over HTTP: a numericals template that is not
# named in data/numericals/index.json is never loaded. Run
# `python generate_data.py --fix-index` to add one.
